id=ashudialer_rootdialer
name=Ashu Phone - Root Dialer (Priv-App)
version=v1.2
versionCode=3
author=Ashu
description=Installs the privileged/root Ashu Phone build with call recording and advanced dialer permissions. Uses Magisk's systemless Magic Mount only - nothing is written to the real /system partition, and this module can be disabled or removed from Magisk's app (or its recovery menu) at any time with zero risk to your device's boot partition.
